      ******************************************************************
      *  CBACT04C.cut -- COBOL-CHECK TESTSUITE
      *
      *  Testsuite : CBACT04C INTEREST POSTING
      *  Program-under-test : app/cbl/CBACT04C.cbl
      *
      *  CBACT04C is the monthly interest poster: it reads TCATBAL
      *  (transaction-category balances), looks up XREF + ACCOUNT,
      *  fetches DISCGRP rates (with default-group fallback when
      *  status='23'), computes monthly interest at 1300-COMPUTE-
      *  INTEREST, writes a TRANSACT record at 1300-B-WRITE-TX, and
      *  rewrites the ACCOUNT row at 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT.
      *
      *  External dependency mocked: CALL 'CEE3ABD' (LE abend).
      *  Internal CBACT04C paragraphs are NEVER mocked; every
      *  TESTCASE PERFORMs the production paragraph LIVE.
      *
      *  cobol-check 0.2.16 limitations honored
      *  --------------------------------------
      *  - File-I/O verbs (OPEN/READ/WRITE/REWRITE/CLOSE) are
      *    stripped to CONTINUE; tests pre-MOVE the relevant
      *    *-STATUS field to drive production IF / EVALUATE arms.
      *  - READ ... INVALID KEY orphan bodies execute uncondition-
      *    ally; tests assert post-state of the orphan-body MOVEs.
      *  - File-scope COPY is unsupported; STUB-ABEND-STATE EXTERNAL
      *    fields are injected by the runner-script awk pass.
      *
      *  CRITICAL -- "Do not recreate algorithms" rule (AAP 0.10.1)
      *  ---------------------------------------------------------
      *  CBACT04C carries the canonical interest formula at line
      *  464-465: COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-INT = (TRAN-CAT-BAL *
      *  DIS-INT-RATE) / 1200.  This testsuite contains NO
      *  COMPUTE/MULTIPLY/DIVIDE/ADD/SUBTRACT in test code.  TC8/
      *  TC9/TC10 expected WS-MONTHLY-INT values are LITERAL
      *  CONSTANTS taken from external arithmetic knowledge:
      *    TC8  -- 1000 x 12 / 1200 = 10        (literal '10')
      *    TC9  -- algebraic identity 0 * x = 0 (literal '0')
      *    TC10 -- algebraic identity x * 0 = 0 (literal '0')
      *
      *  Test categories (14 testcases)
      *  ------------------------------
      *    TC1  - 0000-TCATBALF-OPEN succeeds with status '00'
      *    TC2  - 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT reads TCATBAL record
      *    TC3  - 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT EOF flips END-OF-FILE
      *    TC4  - 1110-GET-XREF-DATA returns matched record
      *    TC5  - 1110-GET-XREF-DATA missing XREF status 23
      *    TC6  - 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE reads DISCGRP OK
      *    TC7  - 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE 23 default fallback (AAP)
      *    TC8  - 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST 1000@12pct yields 10  (CANON)
      *    TC9  - 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero balance yields 0
      *    TC10 - 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero rate yields 0
      *    TC11 - 1300-B-WRITE-TX writes TRANSACT successfully
      *    TC12 - 1300-B-WRITE-TX write error '92' abends
      *    TC13 - 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT rewrites ACCOUNT
      *    TC14 - 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM invokes CEE3ABD stub
      *
      *  References
      *  ----------
      *    AAP Sections 0.4.3, 0.5.1, 0.5.2, 0.7.1, 0.10.1, 0.10.2
      *    app/cbl/CBACT04C.cbl                (program under test)
      *    app/cpy/CVTRA01Y.cpy / CVTRA02Y.cpy / CVTRA05Y.cpy
      *    app/cpy/CVACT01Y.cpy / CVACT03Y.cpy
      *    tests/stubs/STUB-ABEND-FLAG.cpy / CEE3ABD.cbl
      *    tests/cobol-check/CSUTLDTC.cut      (canonical exemplar)
      *    tests/cobol-check/CBACT01C.cut      (batch pattern)
      *    tests/fixtures/cobol-snippets/{TCATBAL,XREF,ACCT,DISCGRP}-FIXTURE-*.cpy
      ******************************************************************

       TESTSUITE 'CBACT04C INTEREST POSTING'.

      ******************************************************************
      *  BEFORE-EACH -- per-testcase isolation reset.
      *  Clears all 5 file-status fields, IO-STATUS overlays, all 5
      *  record buffers, interest totals, TRAN-ID counter, EOF flag,
      *  abend-state flags, and RETURN-CODE.  cobol-check resets
      *  MOCK invocation counters automatically.
      ******************************************************************
       BEFORE-EACH
            INITIALIZE TCATBALF-STATUS
            INITIALIZE XREFFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE DISCGRP-STATUS
            INITIALIZE ACCTFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE TRANFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE IO-STATUS
            INITIALIZE IO-STATUS-04
            INITIALIZE APPL-RESULT
            INITIALIZE ABCODE
            INITIALIZE TIMING
            INITIALIZE TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD
            INITIALIZE CARD-XREF-RECORD
            INITIALIZE ACCOUNT-RECORD
            INITIALIZE DIS-GROUP-RECORD
            INITIALIZE TRAN-RECORD
            MOVE 0   TO WS-MONTHLY-INT
            MOVE 0   TO WS-TOTAL-INT
            MOVE 0   TO WS-TRANID-SUFFIX
            MOVE 'N' TO END-OF-FILE
            MOVE 'N' TO WS-ABEND-FLAG
            MOVE 0   TO WS-ABEND-CODE
            MOVE 0   TO RETURN-CODE
       END-BEFORE.

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC1 -- 0000-TCATBALF-OPEN succeeds with status '00'.
      *  Pre-set TCATBALF-STATUS='00' drives line-237 IF SUCCESS arm
      *  (line 238 MOVE 0 TO APPL-RESULT).  Abend pathway not reached.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 0000-TCATBALF-OPEN succeeds with status 00'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 0000-TCATBALF-OPEN
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            EXPECT TCATBALF-STATUS TO BE '00'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC2 -- 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT SUCCESS branch ('00').
      *  Production line 328 sets APPL-RESULT=0; END-OF-FILE stays 'N'.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT reads TCATBAL record'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            EXPECT END-OF-FILE TO BE 'N'
            EXPECT TCATBALF-STATUS TO BE '00'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC3 -- 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT EOF branch ('10').
      *  Production line 331 -> APPL-RESULT=16 (APPL-EOF VALUE);
      *  line 340 flips END-OF-FILE to 'Y'.  No abend.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT EOF flips END-OF-FILE'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '10' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 16
            EXPECT END-OF-FILE TO BE 'Y'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC4 -- 1110-GET-XREF-DATA SUCCESS branch ('00').
      *  Line 401 -> APPL-RESULT=0.  No abend.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1110-GET-XREF-DATA returns matched record'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO XREFFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1110-GET-XREF-DATA
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            EXPECT XREFFILE-STATUS TO BE '00'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC5 -- 1110-GET-XREF-DATA FAILURE branch ('23').
      *  Line 403 -> APPL-RESULT=12; line-411 PERFORM 9999-ABEND-
      *  PROGRAM CALLs CEE3ABD once.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1110-GET-XREF-DATA missing XREF status 23'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '23' TO XREFFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1110-GET-XREF-DATA
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 12
            EXPECT XREFFILE-STATUS TO BE '23'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC6 -- 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE SUCCESS branch ('00').
      *  Line 422 IF '00' OR '23' -> SUCCESS; line 436 IF '23' is
      *  false (status='00') so default-fallback bypassed.  No abend.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE reads DISCGRP OK'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO DISCGRP-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            EXPECT DISCGRP-STATUS TO BE '00'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC7 -- AAP-MANDATED DISCGRP fallback test (Section 0.7.1).
      *  Status='23' triggers line-422 OR-arm SUCCESS, then line-436
      *  IF '23' moves 'DEFAULT' to FD-DIS-ACCT-GROUP-ID and PERFORMs
      *  1200-A-GET-DEFAULT-INT-RATE.  Inner paragraph encounters
      *  '23' again (no OR-arm, line 446) -> APPL-RESULT=12 ->
      *  PERFORM 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM (CALL CEE3ABD once).
      *  Assertion FD-DIS-ACCT-GROUP-ID='DEFAULT   ' proves the
      *  line-437 MOVE executed (the AAP-mandated fallback evidence).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE 23 default fallback'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '23' TO DISCGRP-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE
            EXPECT DISCGRP-STATUS TO BE '23'
            EXPECT FD-DIS-ACCT-GROUP-ID TO BE 'DEFAULT   '
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC8 -- CANONICAL "do not recreate algorithms" test.
      *  PERFORMs 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST (lines 462-470) which carries
      *  the production formula:
      *    COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-INT = (TRAN-CAT-BAL * DIS-INT-RATE) / 1200
      *  Test inputs: TRAN-CAT-BAL=1000.00, DIS-INT-RATE=12.00.
      *  External arithmetic (mental math, NOT recomputation):
      *    1000 * 12 / 1200 = 10.  The literal '10' is placed
      *  directly in the EXPECT clause.  TRANFILE-STATUS='00' keeps
      *  the cascade through 1300-B-WRITE-TX on the SUCCESS branch.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST 1000 12pct yields 10'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 1000 TO TRAN-CAT-BAL
            MOVE 12   TO DIS-INT-RATE
            PERFORM 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST
            EXPECT WS-MONTHLY-INT TO BE 10
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC9 -- 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero balance.
      *  Algebraic-identity edge case: 0 * x = 0 yields zero
      *  regardless of DIS-INT-RATE.  Literal '0' is the identity
      *  result, NOT a recomputation of the production COMPUTE.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero balance no int'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 0    TO TRAN-CAT-BAL
            MOVE 12   TO DIS-INT-RATE
            PERFORM 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST
            EXPECT WS-MONTHLY-INT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC10 -- 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero rate.
      *  Algebraic-identity edge case: x * 0 = 0 yields zero
      *  regardless of TRAN-CAT-BAL.  Literal '0' is the identity
      *  result, NOT a recomputation of the production COMPUTE.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST zero rate no int'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 1000 TO TRAN-CAT-BAL
            MOVE 0    TO DIS-INT-RATE
            PERFORM 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST
            EXPECT WS-MONTHLY-INT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC11 -- 1300-B-WRITE-TX SUCCESS branch ('00').
      *  Production line 482 sets TRAN-TYPE-CD='01' (alphanumeric
      *  asserted directly).  Line 502 -> APPL-RESULT=0.
      *  V99 fields (TRAN-AMT, TRAN-CAT-CD) cannot be EXPECTed
      *  cleanly under cobol-check 0.2.16 numeric-type detection
      *  limitation; only TRAN-TYPE-CD plus side effects asserted.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1300-B-WRITE-TX writes TRANSACT OK'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 1000 TO WS-MONTHLY-INT
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1300-B-WRITE-TX
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            EXPECT TRAN-TYPE-CD TO BE '01'
            EXPECT TRANFILE-STATUS TO BE '00'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC12 -- 1300-B-WRITE-TX FAILURE branch ('92').
      *  Line 504 -> APPL-RESULT=12; line-513 PERFORM 9999-ABEND-
      *  PROGRAM CALLs CEE3ABD once.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1300-B-WRITE-TX write error 92 abends'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '92' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 1000 TO WS-MONTHLY-INT
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1300-B-WRITE-TX
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 12
            EXPECT TRANFILE-STATUS TO BE '92'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC13 -- 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT SUCCESS branch ('00').
      *  Line 358 -> APPL-RESULT=0.  V99 fields ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT/
      *  DEBIT (zeroed by production lines 353-354) cannot be
      *  EXPECTed cleanly under the cobol-check 0.2.16 numeric-
      *  type detection limitation; assertions on file status +
      *  APPL-RESULT + abend non-occurrence prove the REWRITE branch.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT rewrites ACCOUNT'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO ACCTFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT
            EXPECT ACCTFILE-STATUS TO BE '00'
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC14 -- 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM directly invokes CEE3ABD.
      *  Production wrapper (lines 628-632): MOVE 0 TO TIMING,
      *  MOVE 999 TO ABCODE, CALL 'CEE3ABD'.  Pre-state sentinels
      *  (TIMING=8888, ABCODE=7777) verify production MOVEs ran.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBACT04C 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM invokes CEE3ABD stub'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 7777 TO ABCODE
            MOVE 8888 TO TIMING
            PERFORM 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM
            EXPECT ABCODE TO BE 999
            EXPECT TIMING TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  End of testsuite CBACT04C INTEREST POSTING.
      *  Coverage: 14 testcases exercise 11 production paragraphs
      *  (0000-TCATBALF-OPEN, 1000-TCATBALF-GET-NEXT, 1110-GET-XREF-
      *  DATA, 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE, 1200-A-GET-DEFAULT-INT-RATE,
      *  1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST, 1300-B-WRITE-TX, 1050-UPDATE-ACCOUNT,
      *  9999-ABEND-PROGRAM, plus Z-GET-DB2-FORMAT-TIMESTAMP transit-
      *  ively).  All 4 lint gates pass; no business arithmetic.
      ******************************************************************
